No replacement console I found worked really well with the console
version of UnNetHack. The problem is that the code for the Windows
console version is different than the console code for unixoid OS. I
have an idea on how to change that but currently there is no real
alternative if you want to play locally.

IMO the best option for playing a console version of NetHack or
UnNetHack on Windows is to use putty[1] and connect to a public
server.

With putty, UnNetHack's Unicode mode works flawlessly.

